    "slug": "shivaji-surathkal-ramesh-aravind-detective",
    "title": "Shivaji Surathkal: Ramesh Aravind as a Detective on Screen",
    "description": "Ramesh Aravind plays detective Shivaji Surathkal in Shivaji Surathkal (2020) and its 2023 sequel, directed by Akash Srivatsa.",
